{"3982290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Evac Bay 09", "steam_appid": 3982290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this observation-based horror game, you're trapped in a looping corridor. Your goal is to find the exit by paying close attention to your surroundings. You must identify subtle anomalies to choose the correct path. Miss something strange or out of place, and you're sent back to the start, repeating the cycle. It's a game of meticulous observation, high tension, and psychological pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/ae983ddda1e2ef248e21b8160a326620.poster.avif?t=1759846004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/ae983ddda1e2ef248e21b8160a326620.webm?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/ae983ddda1e2ef248e21b8160a326620.mp4?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last person left on a space station after a catastrophic event. Your only escape is through the looping corridors to the Evacuation Bay 09. But the station or something in it has other plans. The path forward is not what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/949d3361fff6fc979cbaa08312272215.poster.avif?t=1759846004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/949d3361fff6fc979cbaa08312272215.webm?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/949d3361fff6fc979cbaa08312272215.mp4?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are equipped with a wrist-mounted scanner, a crucial tool for survival. As you traverse the seemingly endless hallways, you must observe every detail. Look for subtle changes, impossible objects, or strange anomalies. Is that a giant eye outside the window? Is the cleaner robot behaving strangely? Are you still on the same corridor you just passed? The station is playing tricks on you, and if you miss even one detail, you'll be sent back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/c05e2b385c6c68db7588b690618ffa65.poster.avif?t=1759846004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/c05e2b385c6c68db7588b690618ffa65.webm?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/c05e2b385c6c68db7588b690618ffa65.mp4?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice is critical, and every anomaly you detect brings you one step closer to your goal. The station's corridors are a trap, and only a keen eye and quick wits will see you through. Can you escape before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/4656db057e47582df0ab270624eb2210.poster.avif?t=1759846004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/4656db057e47582df0ab270624eb2210.webm?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/4656db057e47582df0ab270624eb2210.mp4?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this observation-based horror game, you're trapped in a looping corridor. Your goal is to find the exit by paying close attention to your surroundings. You must identify subtle anomalies to choose the correct path. Miss something strange or out of place, and you're sent back to the start, repeating the cycle. It's a game of meticulous observation, high tension, and psychological pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/ae983ddda1e2ef248e21b8160a326620.poster.avif?t=1759846004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/ae983ddda1e2ef248e21b8160a326620.webm?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/ae983ddda1e2ef248e21b8160a326620.mp4?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last person left on a space station after a catastrophic event. Your only escape is through the looping corridors to the Evacuation Bay 09. But the station or something in it has other plans. The path forward is not what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/949d3361fff6fc979cbaa08312272215.poster.avif?t=1759846004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/949d3361fff6fc979cbaa08312272215.webm?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/949d3361fff6fc979cbaa08312272215.mp4?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are equipped with a wrist-mounted scanner, a crucial tool for survival. As you traverse the seemingly endless hallways, you must observe every detail. Look for subtle changes, impossible objects, or strange anomalies. Is that a giant eye outside the window? Is the cleaner robot behaving strangely? Are you still on the same corridor you just passed? The station is playing tricks on you, and if you miss even one detail, you'll be sent back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/c05e2b385c6c68db7588b690618ffa65.poster.avif?t=1759846004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/c05e2b385c6c68db7588b690618ffa65.webm?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/c05e2b385c6c68db7588b690618ffa65.mp4?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice is critical, and every anomaly you detect brings you one step closer to your goal. The station's corridors are a trap, and only a keen eye and quick wits will see you through. Can you escape before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/4656db057e47582df0ab270624eb2210.poster.avif?t=1759846004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/4656db057e47582df0ab270624eb2210.webm?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/extras/4656db057e47582df0ab270624eb2210.mp4?t=1759846004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "You're trapped in the seemingly endless corridors of a space station, desperately searching for the evacuation bay 09. But the station is not as empty as it seems; you must observe for subtle, unsettling occurrences and log them if you want to move forward. Can you break the loop and escape?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/a60b8b0edd601ba67b4e2206100a3a2756ea12e6/header.jpg?t=1759846004", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/1206232c9e1b609e62e5aeb2592b93a24f8f7434/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759846004", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982290/1206232c9e1b609e62e5aeb2592b93a24f8f7434/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759846004", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"